OL,3,GNEWSA'Walk away from drugs' urges
OL,4,Afamily of Waterford arson victims
OL,5,
OL,6,FA relative of four members of the same
OL,7,Ffamily who died after a suspected arson
OL,8,Fattack on a house in Ireland last week
OL,9,Fhas appealed to young people to "walk
OL,10,Faway from drugs".
OL,12,FParents Philip and Kim English died in
OL,13,Fthe fire alongside their two children,
OL,14,F12-year-old Callum and nine-year-old
OL,15,FJayden, in their house in the Birchwood
OL,16,Festate in Waterford.
OL,18,FThe couple's two other children, who
OL,19,Fwere in the house at the time of the
OL,20,Ffire, are in a critical condition in
OL,21,Fhospital.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,419,410,260,120,0,100
